a-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(8317.7,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> g</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>The density of the solution <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.489ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.17ex\" height=\"1.489ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 517 658\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D70C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D70C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is given as 1.15 g/mL. Therefore, the volume in milliliters (which is equivalent to cubic centimeters) is:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.158ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.396ex\" height=\"3.447ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1011.8 5921.1 1523.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1046.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2102.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(777.9,481.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(2000,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> g</text></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-370.3) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> g/mL</text></g></g><rect width=\"3578.6\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.114ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 6680.6 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1046.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2102.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4880.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> mL</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>To convert milliliters to liters (since molarity is defined in terms of liters), we divide by 1000:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.888ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 6580.6 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D449\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D449\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1046.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2102.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(2778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(5380.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> L</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Step 3: Calculate the molarity.</p>\n\n<p>Molarity (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.378ex\" height=\"1.545ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1051 683\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) is defined as the number of moles of solute divided by the volume of solution in liters:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.033ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.545ex\" height=\"2.762ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -764.1 5103 1220.7\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1328.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2384.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(455,451.6) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(633,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-