er class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.158ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.554ex\" height=\"3.447ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1011.8 5991 1523.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1328.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2384.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(353.6,481.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> moles</text></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-370.3) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(2778,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(3278,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> L</text></g></g><rect width=\"3366.4\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.132ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 5362.6 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1328.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2248\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2248\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2384.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4162.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> M</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the molarity of the urea solution is approximately 2.05 M, which corresponds to Option C.</p>"}]}